From bf3e9ecaf22f39d1e9e463a42c5d27fef099ba27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:33:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media-driver: Add missing media_common/agnostic/common/cp
 include dir

A real flashfiles build failed with a fatal file-not-found error:
media_common/agnostic/common/hw/mhw_vebox.h includes "mhw_cp_interface.h",
whose containing directory, media_common/agnostic/common/cp, was
deliberately excluded from the earlier comprehensive include-dirs sweep
as a supposed filename collision against
media_common/agnostic/common/codec/shared (both contain
codec_def_cenc_decode.h).

Diffed the two codec_def_cenc_decode.h copies: they are byte-for-byte
identical, so the 'collision' carries no functional risk regardless of
which -I directory the compiler resolves it from first. Added the
directory; the other two headers it provides (mhw_cp_interface.h,
cp_factory.h) have no duplicate filenames anywhere else in the tree.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 05d96ae9e..1f1037954 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -2073,6 +2073,7 @@ cc_library_shared {
 
     local_include_dirs: [
         "media_common/agnostic/common/codec/shared",
+        "media_common/agnostic/common/cp",
         "media_driver/agnostic/common/cm",
         "media_driver/agnostic/common/codec/hal",
         "media_driver/agnostic/common/codec/kernel",
-- 
2.34.1

